{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 34,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        42.10532760620117,
        139.908203125,
        51.10532760620117
      ],
      "text": "5.1 CHAPTER OBJECTIVES",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.528202056884766,
        60.276031494140625,
        399.9269714355469,
        69.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "This chapter presents the expert panel’s recommendations for conducting contact investi -",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.762203216552734,
        72.27304077148438,
        400.07098388671875,
        81.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "gations, with the strength of the recommendation and the quality of the evidence supporting",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.8972053527832,
        84.27005004882812,
        127.08317565917969,
        93.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "the recommendation.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.90620803833008,
        114.09635925292969,
        140.70022583007812,
        123.09635925292969
      ],
      "text": "5.2 RECOMMENDATIONS",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.91521072387695,
        132.26705932617188,
        402.0599365234375,
        141.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "The reviews of the literature showed limited information on the approaches to and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.93320846557617,
        144.26406860351562,
        399.6931457519531,
        153.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "beneﬁts of contact investigation in high-burden, low-resource settings. Thus, most of the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.52822494506836,
        156.27005004882812,
        267.444091796875,
        165.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "recommendations are based on very low-quality evidence.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.534000396728516,
        186.09934997558594,
        399.6898193359375,
        195.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 1 It is recommended that contact investigation be conducted for house -",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.56600952148438,
        198.26705932617188,
        399.6899719238281,
        207.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "hold and close contacts when the index case has any of the following",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.5570068359375,
        210.26406860351562,
        187.50604248046875,
        219.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "characteristics:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.5570068359375,
        228.26406860351562,
        323.2348937988281,
        237.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "• sputum smear-positive pulmonary tuberculosis,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.56600952148438,
        246.26406860351562,
        295.8840026855469,
        255.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "• MDR-TB or XDR-TB (proven or suspected),",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.57501220703125,
        264.2640686035156,
        183.70802307128906,
        273.2640686035156
      ],
      "text": "• is a PLHIV or",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.57501220703125,
        280.1447448730469,
        235.38607788085938,
        291.2640686035156
      ],
      "text": "< • is a child   5 years of age.",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.58401489257812,
        300.2640686035156,
        326.7198181152344,
        309.27593994140625
      ],
      "text": "Strong recommendation, very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55879211425781,
        330.27294921875,
        161.9298095703125,
        339.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "Remark 1",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.55860900878906,
        342.27606201171875,
        399.4756774902344,
        351.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "Designation as an index case does not necessarily imply that contact",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.47761535644531,
        354.2730712890625,
        399.6195373535156,
        363.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "investigation must be undertaken. In high-burden settings, because of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.49562072753906,
        366.27008056640625,
        399.77276611328125,
        375.27008056640625
      ],
      "text": "competing demands on time and resources, a decision must be taken on",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.63961791992188,
        378.26708984375,
        399.8172607421875,
        387.26708984375
      ],
      "text": "whether to undertake contact investigation and, if so, how to prioritize",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.69361877441406,
        390.26409912109375,
        401.7523498535156,
        399.26409912109375
      ],
      "text": "index cases. Detailed clinical information on the index case is the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.6666259765625,
        402.2611083984375,
        399.6915588378906,
        411.27911376953125
      ],
      "text": "foun da tion of contact investigation. Sputum smear microscopy and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.567626953125,
        414.276123046875,
        399.70025634765625,
        423.276123046875
      ],
      "text": "radiographic features establish the degree of infectiousness and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.57662963867188,
        426.27313232421875,
        399.4757080078125,
        435.27313232421875
      ],
      "text": "correlate independently with the likelihood of infection among contacts",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.34263610839844,
        438.2701416015625,
        399.6734924316406,
        447.2701416015625
      ],
      "text": "(32,33). Contacts of known or suspected cases of MDR-TB and XDR-TB",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.53163146972656,
        450.2671203613281,
        399.64666748046875,
        459.2671203613281
      ],
      "text": "should be evaluated as described for contacts of drug-sensitive cases",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.51362609863281,
        462.2609558105469,
        399.56158447265625,
        471.2641296386719
      ],
      "text": "but with greater urgency because of the potential consequences of drug-",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.43800354003906,
        474.2579345703125,
        401.6767578125,
        483.27593994140625
      ],
      "text": "resistant TB should it develop in the contact. Additional information",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.59100341796875,
        486.2729187011719,
        399.4536437988281,
        495.2729187011719
      ],
      "text": "to be obtained from index patients should include a description of their",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.33000183105469,
        498.2699279785156,
        399.2829284667969,
        507.2699279785156
      ],
      "text": "residence and, when relevant, of other sites in which transmission might",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.28500366210938,
        510.2669372558594,
        399.2464599609375,
        519.2669677734375
      ],
      "text": "have occurred. Information that is essential for determining the potential",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.12300109863281,
        522.2630004882812,
        272.944091796875,
        531.2639770507812
      ],
      "text": "risk posed by the index case includes:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.12611389160156,
        540.2630004882812,
        394.6689147949219,
        549.2630004882812
      ],
      "text": "• the results of sputum smears or other microbiological evaluations;",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.13511657714844,
        558.2630004882812,
        327.9521179199219,
        567.27197265625
      ],
      "text": "• radiographic features of the disease (if available);",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.53111267089844,
        576.27197265625,
        381.41070556640625,
        585.273681640625
      ],
      "text": "• the severity, type and duration of symptoms (especially cough);",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.53887939453125,
        594.273681640625,
        317.0518493652344,
        603.273681640625
      ],
      "text": "• the presence of risk factors for drug resistance;",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.54788208007812,
        612.273681640625,
        285.5608215332031,
        621.273681640625
      ],
      "text": "• known or presumed HIV infection; and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.556884765625,
        630.273681640625,
        290.58282470703125,
        639.273681640625
      ],
      "text": "• the setting in which exposure occurred.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        217.57310485839844,
        651.97265625,
        224.6381072998047,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "32",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}